{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object approached, grab it, process it and take to destination; if visible, approach, scan properties; finally explore.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObjectToDestination    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = ExploreArea    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ScanObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    />",
